7.1 Onboarding (3 screens maximum)

1. Value: “Keep the promises you make.”
2. Demonstration: dictation → preview → reminder (interactive sample).
3. Privacy/permissions: explain on-device processing and request microphone/speech/notifications only when functionality is invoked. Provide “Continue without permissions.”

