• Header with date and friendly count: “2 due today · 1 overdue.”
• Segmented filter: Needs attention / Upcoming / Waiting.
• Priority card for nearest actionable commitment.
• List rows show action, person avatar/initials, due badge, next action, quick Done.
• Bottom persistent Capture control and access to search.
• Empty states with simple actionable prompts; avoid guilt-inducing language.

7.3 Capture sheet

• Large microphone action, real-time transcript area.
• Text keyboard alternative.
• Processing indication and cancel control.
• Extracted draft cards with person/date chips; highlight ambiguous fields.
• “Save all” and independent per-card save; destructive discard confirmation.

7.4 Commitment detail

• Title, linked person, status, promised-to relationship.
• Due date and next reminder.
• Context/notes and original source.
• Next action and waiting-on.
• Primary Done CTA; secondary Edit, Snooze, Reschedule.
• Timeline of changes, including reminder interactions.

7.5 People

• Searchable list sorted by outstanding commitments or name.
• Person profile: Open, Waiting, Completed history, optional notes.
• Merge suggestions only; never merge without review.

7.6 History

• Completed and cancelled items, filters by month/person.
• Completion stats should be informative without fabricated productivity scoring.

7.7 Settings

• Notification rules and daily digest time.
• Siri & Shortcuts setup with tested phrase examples.
• Privacy, model availability, permission diagnostics.
• Export, import, delete data, backup/sync state.
• Subscription management / restore purchases.
• Accessibility/language preferences.

