18. Open product decisions to resolve with empirical testing

These do not block building the P0 core:

• Whether the best price is $6.99, $8.99, or $9.99 monthly; test landing-page conversion and paid cohort retention.
• Whether annual subscriptions outperform a one-time purchase for privacy-minded users.
• Whether the initial niche should be freelancers, client-facing sales, or consultants.
• Whether users prefer explicit “promise to” wording or generic “I need to” capture.
• Whether advanced follow-up drafting is actually used enough to sustain premium conversion.
• Whether Polish should be offered at launch, based on device/model transcription and extraction performance.

