19. Recommended build brief for an implementation agent

Build the app described above as a complete production-quality native SwiftUI iOS app. Implement all P0 requirements, not just screenshots, UI mocks, stub model calls, or in-memory examples. Ship persistent domain storage, true speech and Apple Foundation Models adapters with runtime availability detection, safe schema extraction, deterministic date handling, Siri/App Intents, local notification scheduling, StoreKit 2 entitlements, accessibility, complete error states and tests. Use the native Apple-supported frameworks where available, and implement manual fallback when they are unavailable. Confirm actual API names against the installed SDK and Apple documentation; do not invent APIs. Do not introduce third-party AI API costs or background audio surveillance. Test the full journey on physical devices and explicitly report any hardware/device workflows that cannot be executed in the build environment.

